1 पृच् पृण॑क्ति पृङ्क्ते॑ etc., pp. पृक्त॑ (q.v.) mix,
mingle, unite or combine with (instr., r. loc.);
 fill, satiate;
 bestow
richly, lavish upon (loc.);
 augment, increase. —आ mix or unite with
(instr.);
 fill, satiate (M. refl.);
 pervade, penetrate. उप add to
(loc.), increase, augment;
 approach, esp. for sexual intercourse. वि
bring asunder, separate from (instr.);
 scatter, disperse, fill, satiate.
सम् A.M. mix, mingle, join, touch;
 fill, endow, present with (instr.).
— Cf. अनुपृक्त, स॑पृक्त.
